Aaj Day 1 ke Triggers + bulkification ke upar next layer build karenge: SOQL + Apex Collections + Test Classes, then Java Collections, and finally Git merge/conflict + CI/CD/Harness thinking. Ye combination interviews me bahut frequently ek saath aa jata hai.

